"Sylbera is a persona of Syl the slime, housed in Syl's sub-core Beta."
"Sylbera's dwarf body is slime; she works on Tanglebay through a network cut off from Syl."
"Syl gave Sylbera her smithing classes outright, and one level each of Mage, Sorcerer, Elementalist."
"Sylbera works rare metals only when she blends them with Syl's metal slime."
